## Interface: 16001
## Title: AuctionatorSync
## Notes: Auction house price sync between players with AuctionatorSync installed. New auction data is synced and shared automatically whenever someone views or scans the auction house and discovers new prices. Browse the auction house listings at any time (/ah).
